('127.671.d.5.C',4,'A function of a network operating system is controlling:','["mouse speed", "who can access shared files", "screen brightness", "keyboard color"]'::jsonb,1,'Access control is central.','original'),
('127.671.d.5.D',3,'When a computer cannot reach the internet, a first troubleshooting step is to check the:','["speakers", "desk lamp", "cables and connection", "mouse pad"]'::jsonb,2,'Start with the simplest causes.','original'),
('127.671.d.5.D',4,'A technician restarts a router to fix a connection issue. This is a common troubleshooting:','["accident", "distraction", "gamble", "technique"]'::jsonb,3,'Rebooting clears many faults.','original'),
('127.671.d.6.A',3,'In a word processor, setting the space between lines is called:','["line spacing", "bandwidth", "file size", "pixel depth"]'::jsonb,0,'Spacing is a formatting term.','original'),
('127.671.d.6.A',4,'The term for the white space around the edges of a page is:','["footnote", "margin", "header", "tab stop"]'::jsonb,1,'Margins frame the text.','original'),
('127.671.d.6.B',3,'Numbering the pages of a long report uses the function of:','["encryption", "compression", "pagination", "hyperlinking"]'::jsonb,2,'Pagination numbers pages.','original')
